s":0.9233453869819641,"text_excerpt":"Big ups to the whole staff at Dashing for being really dang helpful and knowledgeable and not in the rude bike hipster kind of way (you know the kind I speak of). As soon as I saw the one I laid my eyes on, well... It was bike Love at first sight! This is my first time investing in a nice ride, and I am stoked I got it here. They helped me adjust it correctly, answered all my questions kindly and were just great in general. I'll send peeps this way!"},{"business_id":"gvA1QnLqzt7QwuAmDyzbRA","review_id":"vUwXY-V8If97c-ek8dajEA","date":"2017-05-30T03:07:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9085351228713989,"text_excerpt":"On Saturday, I brought my bike in for what I thought was a minor fix, but in stead it needed a tune up. Marin was was so nice and explained what need to be done. So I left it with her thinking I wouldn't get it back till Tuesday. My bike was ready to be picked up the next day! And a tuneup is only $50 and it is worth it. My bike rides like the day I bought it from Dashing Bike! I will definitely be going back for all of my bike repairs. Marin is very professional and she knows what she is doing."},{"business_id":"gvA1QnLqzt7QwuAmDyzbRA","review_id":"4yeLr9eLb9n7ygbGm6bwng","date":"2018-09-01T19:30:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8974237442016602,"text_excerpt":"Called the shop to get a registration # for the bike I bought there 2 years ago. they were very nice, took my info and called me back quickly with the info."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
